# Out Cold {3}{U}: "Tap up to two target creatures and put a stun counter on each of them. Investigate." Four Moxen pay for it exactly. Bot1 taps and stuns its own Memnite
# and Bot2's Ornithopter (a Mox is no creature: refused), already tapped or not (CR 122.1d), then investigates once: Bot1 gets the one Clue, Bot2 none (CR 701.16a). On turn 4
# Bot2's untap step spends the Ornithopter's stun counter instead of untapping it (CR 122.1d).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Ornithopter
Out Cold
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

